WEBVTT

00:03:56.335 --> 00:04:00.387
"No written word, no spoken plea

00:04:00.411 --> 00:04:02.976
can teach our youth what they should be;

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:05.382
nor all the books on all the shelves --

00:04:05.406 --> 00:04:07.634
it's what the teachers are themselves."

00:04:07.658 --> 00:04:11.451
That made an impression
on me in the 1930s.

00:04:11.475 --> 00:04:15.750
And I tried to use that
more or less in my teaching,

00:04:15.774 --> 00:04:20.346
whether it be in sports, or whether
it be in the English classroom.

00:04:20.370 --> 00:04:26.174
I love poetry and always had
an interest in that somehow.

00:04:26.198 --> 00:04:29.976
Maybe it's because Dad
used to read to us at night,

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:31.158
by coal oil lamp --